"Three people divided an amount of $1920. The second took $80 more than the first, and the third took twice what the second took. Calculate the share of the first one.",Three people divided an amount of $1920. The second took $80 more than the first and the third took twice what the second took. Calculate the share of the first one.,420,420,420,420,"- Let the first person's share be x dollars.
