"Sally went to the seashore for vacation. Her parents gave her $10 to buy whatever she wanted. At the trinket shop, taffy was on sale for ""Buy 1 pound at $3, get 1 pound 1/2 off."" She scooped up 2pounds. She also bought a mixed bag of seashells for $1.50 and 4 magnets that were $0.25 each. How much money does Sally have left?","Sally went to the seashore for vacation. Her parents gave her $10 to buy whatever she wanted. At the trinket shop, taffy was on sale for ""Buy 1 pound at $3, get 1 pound 1/2 off."" She scooped up 2 pounds. She also bought a mixed bag of seashells for $1.50 and 4 magnets that were $0.25 each. How much money does Sally have left?",3,3,3.00,3.00,"- Starting money: $10.00

- Taffy deal: Buy 1 lb at $3, get 1 lb half off
